            "created_at": "2025-08-19T12:49:20.064295+00:00",
            "notes": "[Pulse Converter](item_a93a8a8e-28d1-4b02-8d80-3234f9eea3dc) is the best bang for your buck, and it'll make sure you never waste the half-second of auto-aim you get from [Super Visor](item_b3db0ab0-26b4-4d99-893d-175f6726c9e9) by having to reload during it.\n\n[Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) is great for burning away the armor/shields of enemy tanks, and can be even better if some of the squishier opponents picked up armor or shields for defense. It's great if you can coordinate with your team to burst down tanks, but even if not, it'll help you put out as much damage as possible to pressure the enemy team and make more money.\n\nIf you're up against an enemy Junker Queen, don't take [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66), as you won't be able to proc its effect reliably and you won't get as much out of it.\n\nIf you've got more cash than the build accounts for at this point, buy some of the optional blues. [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) is often a great pick since it's very cheap and boosts both your weapon damage and rockets.\n\nAs your item slots start filling up, sell greens for space rather than splurging on purple items too early. You'll usually get more value out of 3 blues and 3 greens than 1 purple and 5 greens.",
