        {
            "id": "d5110e67-d344-4bec-ba1e-f4a661a907ba",
            "build_id": "9d4e3007-650f-4145-8042-69dd3852ce9e",
            "round_number": 5,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-19T12:49:20.064295+00:00",
            "notes": "Your power choice here can flex a few different ways based on how the match is going.\n\n[Cratered](item_5bb876bf-52b5-496c-a9ea-b68e72ed3be1) can make it even easier to do more damage consistently and gives you a bit more damage output, but it's not the only good option.\n\nIf you're having trouble staying alive (especially if you're frequently the target of divers like Genji/Reaper/D.Va, or medium/long range heroes like Cassidy or Freya are giving you trouble), take [On Me!](item_cd2a0247-bc79-4f0b-b9ee-d985e3f9a9a7) to give yourself some extra health and more mobility, since you won't have to choose between staying in your biotic field or sprinting to cover.\n\nIf you're going up against a Junker Queen (who doesn't have the ability to block or nullify your shots with barriers, bubbles, etc.), or if you're facing off against a lot of flyers, or the enemy team doesn't have much else to deal with your auto-aim shots (Genji's deflect, Mei walls, etc.), then [Peripheral Pulse](item_f024f11e-2fff-40cf-9e2d-fbaa21fa1371) can be a strong choice.\n\nIf your team is having trouble taking down barriers from Reinhardt, Sigma, or Orisa (if she took [Shield Divergence](item_6577581c-389a-466b-af28-158e2a11ac37)), then [Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61) is another item option, but don't feel obligated if you can manage without it. There are usually better choices, but sometimes it can make all the difference. If you go this route, consider picking [Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) this round as well.\n\nFor item picks, I recommend [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) if you chose [Cratered](item_5bb876bf-52b5-496c-a9ea-b68e72ed3be1) or [On Me!](item_cd2a0247-bc79-4f0b-b9ee-d985e3f9a9a7) as your power. It's going to be the biggest boost to both your burst and sustained damage, especially if you're keeping up with using your rockets on cooldown.\n\nIf you picked up a a weapon-based power ([Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) or [Peripheral Pulse](item_f024f11e-2fff-40cf-9e2d-fbaa21fa1371)) instead here, you're probably better off taking an item that will boost your weapon damage more, like [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27), [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) (if you can afford it), [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f), or even [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4)( Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) only).",
